### 14.9 Where the proof stands after four rounds [V]

**Pre-registered verdict: FAIL in every arm of every round (4, 5, 6 and 7; 15 arms, `omni_lab` eval runs 38060-38063, 38110-38113, 38156-38159, 38238-38240).** The iteration budget (three architecture rounds after round 4) is spent. By the task's own condition the 2B is not launched.

**Every modality goes IN through the one untyped trunk.** Text, image class, video pan, speech speaker, music source and 3D shape pass their rules on both untyped seeds in rounds 5 and 7. The misses elsewhere are all speech speaker: round 4 s0 at 0.690, and round 6 s0 / s1 at 0.600 / 0.650. Every result is at the level of the typed control. Video pan went from 0.500 (round 1, every arm) to 0.995-1.000 once the round-3 data rules were in. Speech speaker sits on the 0.70 line (0.60-0.78 across all arms).

**Raw OUT is proven only in part.**
- **Passed on both untyped seeds of one round:** music out (round 4: 0.850 / 0.750) and 3D out (round 5: 0.450 / 1.000).
- **Passed on one seed only:** image out (round 4 s0 0.475, round 5 s0 0.700; the other seed 0.225 / 0.350).
- **Never passed, in any arm of any round, typed control included:** image mirror edit (best 0.650), video out (best 0.625), speech out (best 0.375, typed round 4; every untyped arm ≤ 0.125).
- Because the typed control fails the same three, **the defect is not the untyped sharing.** It is the generation side of the proxy as trained here: 9.8M (or 72M) parameters for 6,000 steps, with about 24k examples per generation behaviour.

**What the measurements say about the three that never pass.**
- **Edit:** the model never uses its source. Edit x0 MSE equals class-conditional image x0 MSE in every round (for example 0.099 against 0.105, round 5 s0), and the decoded outputs are class-coloured 2x2 blob mosaics unrelated to the source photo (`runs/view/r4_edit.png`). The route exists (the context span reaches the suffix, pinned in tests); it is not learned at this budget.
- **Video out:** frames are per-row blobs with no coherent content to move, so the displacement instrument reads noise (0.35-0.63).
- **Speech out:**
  - In rounds 5-7 speech requests decode as music (band or piano) on all but a handful of the 40 per arm, even with the kind header and in the typed control.
  - Without the skip, raw-audio x0 MSE stays above the signal variance (0.31-0.35 against 0.25, also at width 768). With the skip it reaches 0.146-0.184 and the level is right, but the content still does not follow the request.
  - The generated spectra are wrong in a measurable way (`code/hf_energy.py`, median fraction of energy above 8 kHz):
    - real speech and music test windows: 0.0000-0.0002;
    - generated speech in the untyped arms: 0.0266 (round 4 s0), 0.0242 (round 5 s0), 0.0064 (round 7 s1);
    - with the x0 skip: 0.3750 (round 6 s0), i.e. level-correct white noise;
    - the round-4 typed control comes closest at 0.0004.

**Mechanisms tried and not adopted** (all shared, none type-indexed, all switches stay off in the profiles): A8 reverse media scan, classifier-free guidance (w = 3), the parameter-free x0 skip, and a 4:1 proxy width. **Kept in the round-7 recipe:** kind-naming audio headers (a proof data rule, not a profile field). They are neutral on the gates and are the in-band form of the kind the typed control reads from its table. Draft-then-refine helped video and music out in the round-4 diagnostic arm.

**Not established, and the obvious next measurements (not run):**
1. **Budget.** Every failing behaviour sits near chance with large seed variance (image out 0.700 vs 0.350 on two seeds). The next run is a longer schedule on one configuration (round 4 + draft 1/2), with per-behaviour learning curves, before any further architecture change.
2. **Edit:** a copy-only control (the source, unflipped, as the target) to tell "cannot route a context span" from "cannot mirror".
3. **Speech out:** a speech-only generation arm, to separate a capacity limit from interference with the five other generation tasks.

**The init ruling is unaffected.** Every proxy here is trained from random init as an architecture probe, and no proxy weight goes anywhere. The base model stays fold-built (`V2_INIT_RULE`; the 2B preflight refuses anything else).

